== 6. Lo que dice ?stl de los saltos y de los bucles ==
s.jump, t.jump, l.jump: integers at least one to increase speed of the respective smoother.  Linear interpolation happens between every '*.jump'-th value.  
robust: logical indicating if robust fitting be used in the 'loess' procedure.  inner: integer; the number of 'inner' (backfitting) iterations; 
inner: integer; the number of 'inner' (backfitting) iterations; usually very few (2) iterations suffice.  outer: integer; the number of 'outer' robustness iterations. 
outer: integer; the number of 'outer' robustness iterations.  na.action: action on missing values.  
